dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.text.diff
version 1
schema s.stdio.semio.text
start body
framing record

# UNIFIED-COMPOSABLE-ARTIFACT-SYSTEM text wave: real binary diff frame. `format u8` + `presence u8`
# (bit0=`runs`) are two REAL fixed fields; when present, `runs` follows as a real varint count +
# per-run repeated record — modeled as one opaque trailing `payload` chain (the
# `protocol-array-of-records` gap every sibling subset's own diff protocol uses at this boundary).
# The real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` (`../../🦀️.rs`) stays genuinely, fully
# structured — round-trip tested independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
